        "original_id": "45453dc5-7e56-5b28-8974-7d337ba432e6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Robinsons, Pocari Sweat, Robinsons barley water\n- Companies: Britvic, Otsuka Pharmaceutical\n- People: Hugh Manning, Kathleen Harrison\n- Roles: Butler\n- Places: England, Japan, East Asia, Southeast Asia, Middle East\n- Events: Pocari Sweat launch, Mrs Thursday television series, Robinsons television commercials\n\nFacts:\n- Robinsons is an English fruit drink brand owned by Britvic.\n- Pocari Sweat is a Japanese sports drink manufactured by Otsuka Pharmaceutical.\n- Pocari Sweat was launched in 1980.\n- Pocari Sweat is available in East Asia, Southeast Asia, and the Middle East.\n- In 1966, Hugh Manning starred in the television series Mrs Thursday alongside Kathleen Harrison.\n- In Mrs Thursday, Hugh Manning played a suave and imperturbable Butler.\n- Hugh Manning’s Butler character also appeared in popular television commercials endorsing the qualities of Robinsons barley water.",
